 "how": "rotopt -template mage_arcane -race SkyborneHighOrder -durs 180 -eval, the preset's knobs (blastBuff=4,blastRefresh=0,barrageBeforeBlast=1,arcaneWrath=0,conserveMana=20,filler=2,missileBarrage=1,barrageFirst=0,evocationMana=0,gems=0,prepull=1,powerWithTrinket=1,pomWrath=0,finisher=1,finishPad=0.75,wand=1) plus prepullAt=1.47 (new knob, tools/rotopt/mage_arcane.go). The preset starts the opener at -1.5 sec; Arcane Blast hits as its cast ends and has no flight time, so at 1.4706 sec it hit at -0.03 sec, before the pull, where its damage doesn't count. A knob search at High Order (3000 iterations) kept every other knob. Wind Blessed is now worth +6.8 (0.76%; was +1.8). Paired over 20000 iterations."
